`RequestProject/YangMills/RestrictedSymbolPatch.lean`.

* `restrictedSymbol_entry_ge_on_patch`, `cellIntegral_restricted_ge`: the patch
  compiler on `V = W+Q+R`, giving the cell-integral floor `(δ/4)(c − 2e)`.
* At the project's candidate patch (half-width `1/8`, Wilson floor `√2/2`) the
  floor is `√2/64 − e/16`, and

      restricted_patch_survives_iff :  0 < floor  ↔  e < √2/4,

